						<r3d:remarks>The research tool ODIN is the abbrevaition of &quot;Oceanographic Database research with Interactive Navigation&quot;. It refers to a tool which permits a rather convenient research of the data stock of the IOWDB. It is possible to restrict the data request to certain projects, stations, parameters, time or depth intervals or geographic regions. The supported output file formats are Blueprint, ASCII table, Excel sheet or NetCDF.</r3d:remarks>
